    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">以一個動作，你可以對距你30尺內的一名可見生物揮舞這張卡片，並嘗試將其變成石頭。目標必須成功通過一次DC 17的體質豁免，否則它開始變成石頭並被束縛。受影響的目標必須在其下一輪結束時重新進行豁免。豁免成功時，目標身上的此效果結束。豁免失敗時，目標被石化，直到通過<em>高等復原術greater restoration</em>或類似法術將石化移除爲止。這一特性一經使用，直到次日黎明之前無法再次使用。</span></p><p>As an action, you can brandish this card at one creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself and attempt to turn it to stone. The target must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=17]] saving throw, or it begins to turn to stone and has the &amp;Reference[condition=restrained] condition. The affected target must repeat the saving throw at the end of its next turn. On a successful save, the effect ends on the target. On a failed save, the target has the &amp;Reference[condition=petrified] condition (instead of the &amp;Reference[condition=restrained] condition) until it is removed by the @spell[Greater Restoration] spell or similar magic. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></div>",
